434
00:24:02,400 --> 00:24:03,440 
- Duduklah.
- Jaga mereka.

435
00:24:03,520 --> 00:24:04,400 
- Kau duduk di sini saja.
- Duduklah.

436
00:24:06,040 --> 00:24:07,520 
Jangan pegang lagi, berikan kepadaku saja.

437
00:24:08,120 --> 00:24:09,160 
